    "notes": {
      "checkpoint": [
        "Nugget Bridge (Route24 map.json) is x 10..12 from row 32 north to row 16, the city's columns 22..24 (offset 12). Its five trainers stand on it facing across, sight 2, so each line crosses the middle column 11 on the trainer's row: Bug Catcher Cale (12, 31), Lass Ali (10, 28), Youngster Timmy (12, 25), Lass Reli (10, 22) and Camper Ethan (12, 19). Each is fought on the step onto their row, beside them: they don't walk, and the player keeps facing north. Two tiles separate the rows, walked as one short leg; the step onto a row goes on a tile at a time until the trainer sees the player (\"trainer_line\"), as the open leg onto the bridge ended a tile short twice on console B (2026-11-03), on (11, 33), and one step left the player out of Cale's sight. Then the Rocket (12, 15): the step onto (11, 15) (Route24_EventScript_RocketTriggerRight, VAR_MAP_SCENE_ROUTE24 0) gives the NUGGET, \"join Team Rocket\", and his battle; he only turns, and the player turns east to him. Camper Shane (5, 21) looks north from the west bank, off the way."
      ],
